---
// /shows/night-night/ — port of v1 shows/night-night.html.
// v1 permalink: /shows/night-night/.

import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SectionTitle from '../../../components/SectionTitle.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Aerial Edge — Night Night">
  <div class="full">
    <div class="row">
      <div class="large-8 columns large-centered">
        <SectionTitle smallTitle="2023 events" title="Night Night" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="full no-padding">
    <div class="row">
      <div class="large-6 columns">
        <img src="/assets/images/shows/Night-Night-LoRes.jpg" />
      </div>

      <div class="large-6 columns">
        <h3>Night Night: The Circus of Nightmares</h3>
        <p>Dare you drift into the land of nod, if you can't be sure what you'll find there? What if you can never get back out, and you stay trapped in your nightmare?</p>

        <p>Night Night takes you through a nail-biting Halloween nightmare trying to escape the grip of dream paralysis demons through adventures with flying trapeze and other aerial acrobatics such as rope, silks, hoop, Chinese Pole and more.</p>

        <p>The haunting experience in this show, performed by Aerial Edge instructors, could keep you awake for weeks, especially if you take home some unexpected guests…</p>

        <p>Tickets are strictly limited because director Helen Anderson and filmography Gabriel Stella are preparing an adventurous production like no other ever seen at Aerial Edge, so space will be restricted.</p>

        <p>The show's exciting and immersive integrations of cinematography with live performance will make this a special nightmare you WILL want to remember.</p>

        <p><b>NOTE: PARENTAL GUIDANCE ADVISED</b></p>

        <p>This show's Halloween theme means that some scenes may be disturbing for younger children. There will also be strobe lights in use. If you'd like more specific information, just drop us an email at info@aerialedge.co.uk</p>
      </div>
      <div class="one spacing"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="four spacing"></div>

  <div style="text-align:center">
    <a href="https://www.tickettailor.com/events/aerialedgecircusschoolcic/" target="_blank" class="button small">Buy Tickets</a>
    <div class="four spacing"></div>
    <div class="row">
      <div class="full no-padding">
        <div class="large-6 columns">
          <div style="text-align: center;">
            <h3>Promo 1</h3>
          </div>
          <iframe width="512" height="288" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/kjFTqTkWsXY?si=jk8jxwdVnOyvr-kc" title="YouTube video player" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowfullscreen></iframe>
          <div class="one spacing"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="large-6 columns">
          <div style="text-align: center;">
            <h3>Promo 2</h3>
          </div>
          <iframe width="512" height="288" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/DVYo43utugE?si=URtZlZnuZSTdLg2J" title="YouTube video player" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowfullscreen></iframe>
          <div class="one spacing"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="four spacing"></div>
    <div class="row">
      <div style="text-align: left;">
        <h3>Dress code: creative!</h3>

        <p>Join the Halloween spirit by coming to the show dressed as whatever you fancy. It could be spooks, ghouls, your favourite celeb from current or historical times, a scary or cuddly animal, whatever you see in your dreams or nightmares. Maybe it will keeps the demons at bay...</p>

        <p>Dressing up is, of course, optional...but is IS fun AND there will be a prize for the best costumes!</p>

        <h3>Party on!</h3>

        <p>Join us for the after-show party! If you're making the effort to create a Halloween costume, you'll want to wear it all evening so we'll convert the reception area to a dance floor and have some fun. Kids welcome too. </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="four spacing"></div>
  <div class="four spacing"></div>
</BaseLayout>
